  ('LBN-2018-005', NULL, 'Passed to fulfill Lebanon''s obligations under UN Convention Against Corruption (ratified 2008). Amended in 2020 to allow Public Prosecution to receive disclosures alongside NACC.', 'en', 'Whistleblower Protection Law — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Recent Legislation - Anti-Corruption and Transparency'),
