  ('LBN-2014-008', NULL, 'First Lebanese law criminalizing domestic violence. Result of years of advocacy by KAFA and women''s organizations. Does not criminalize marital rape. Amended in 2020 to strengthen penalties for economic/psychological violence.', 'en', 'Law on Protection of Women and Family Members from Domestic Violence — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Recent Legislation - Women''s Rights and Protection'),
