  ('LBN-2018-011', 'Article 10.7', 'Divulgation de la propriété effective des entreprises contractantes et sous-traitantes', 'fr', 'Law on Enhancing Transparency in the Petroleum Sector, Article Article 10.7', 'Beneficial Ownership Disclosure', 'Recent Legislation - Anti-Corruption and Transparency'),
