  ('LBN-2020-017', 'Article 3', 'Fermeture frontières, écoles, universités, institutions privées', 'fr', 'Decree Declaring State of General Mobilization to Counter Coronavirus Spread, Article Article 3', 'Closures', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
