  ('LBN-2021-018', NULL, 'Provided legal framework for COVID-19 vaccination campaign. Shielded healthcare providers and manufacturers from liability. Allowed private sector to procure vaccines alongside government.', 'en', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
