  ('LBN-TAX-006', NULL, 'Stamp duty is one of Lebanon''s oldest taxes, applying to various documents and transactions. The law distinguishes between proportionate and fixed stamp duties.', 'en', 'Stamp Duty Law — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Tax Law'),
